{
 "note": "Stage out plant: plant_get -> plant_water (loop) -> plant_put. Stage B format: each frame is the whole set baked on one canvas; anchor = pixel of the set origin (the hand-off spot). Hand-off: plant_get frame 0 and plant_put's last frame are pixel-identical to the props-only frame + the Stage A idle sprite (frame 0). Joins: plant_get last = plant_water 0 = plant_put 0. Face baked. Stage out sweep: sweep_get -> sweep (loop) -> sweep_put. Stage B format: each frame is the whole set baked on one canvas; anchor = pixel of the set origin (the hand-off spot). Hand-off: sweep_get frame 0 and sweep_put's last frame are pixel-identical to the props-only frame + the Stage A idle sprite (frame 0). Joins: sweep_get last = sweep 0 = sweep_put 0. Face baked. Stage out snow: snow_kneel -> snow_build (loop) -> snow_stand. Stage B format: each frame is the whole set baked on one canvas; anchor = pixel of the set origin (the hand-off spot). Hand-off: snow_kneel frame 0 and snow_stand's last frame are pixel-identical to the props-only frame + the Stage A idle sprite (frame 0). Joins: snow_kneel last = snow_build 0 = snow_stand 0. Face baked. Stage out fish: fish_sit -> fish_wait (loop) -> fish_stand. Stage B format: each frame is the whole set baked on one canvas; anchor = pixel of the set origin (the hand-off spot). Hand-off: fish_sit frame 0 and fish_stand's last frame are pixel-identical to the props-only frame + the Stage A idle sprite (frame 0). Joins: fish_sit last = fish_wait 0 = fish_stand 0. fish_wait: face layers from face_out.json set_clips (patch in face_patch_dir); the rest baked. Stage out cap: cap_get_in_bed -> cap_sleep (loop) -> cap_wake_up. Stage B format: each frame is the whole set baked on one canvas; anchor = pixel of the set origin (the hand-off spot). Hand-off: cap_get_in_bed frame 0 and cap_wake_up's last frame are pixel-identical to the props-only frame + the Stage A idle sprite (frame 0). Joins: cap_get_in_bed last = cap_sleep 0 = cap_wake_up 0. Face baked.",
